"13. Doctrine of promissory estoppel has been explained and expounded in several decisions of the Supreme Court, (see Motilal Padampat Sugar Mills Co. Ltd. versus State of U.P. (1979) 2 SCC 409; State of Arunachal Pradesh versus Nezone Law House, (2008) 5 SCC 609; Sharma Transport versus Govt. Of A.P., (2002) 2 SCC 188;
